<title>USA: U.S. STOCK INDEX FUTURES LOWER, EYE WEAK T-BONDS.</title>
<headline>U.S. STOCK INDEX FUTURES LOWER, EYE WEAK T-BONDS.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 11 - U.S. stock index futures were lower, in step with weak T-bonds. Sept S&amp;P 500 lower, within Friday's big range. Support pegged at Friday's low of 926.75. No data Monday, traders await retail sales, PPI, CPI this week.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk, 312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
